Package: fmridataset
Type: Package
Title: Spatially Typed Annotated fMRI Datasets
Version: 0.10.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", 
                  email = "bbuchsbaum@gmail.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5800-9890"))
Description: Provides spatially typed, annotated observation-by-feature
    containers for functional magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI) data. The
    package aligns lazy numerical assays with observation metadata, feature
    metadata, experimental entities, and explicit neuroimaging spaces while
    retaining compatibility with NIfTI, HDF5, BIDS, and in-memory sources.
